hat the  abduction happened at all  nigeria's government put measures to  prevent school abductions  after the armed group boko haram  kidnapped 276 schoolgirls  at chibok in 2014.  six years later more than 100 of the  girls are still missing  the fear for parents in katsina state is  that their sons could suffer the same  fate  barbara angopa al jazeera
 

